@guide H_SwampOfSorrows
@name Swamp of Sorrows (Stonard)
@faction Horde
@levels 39-42
@zone Swamp of Sorrows
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Stonard: the captured beasts, the Pool of Tears artifacts and the crocolisk hunts, Magtoor's draenethyst crystals, then the Misty Reed Strand where Tok'Kar and Katar fight the murlocs of the coast.
@next H_Dustwallow

note From Grom'gol ride north through Duskwood (Alliance zone: keep off the roads) and east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows.
accept Draenethyst Crystals | Magtoor, a Lost One in the hut at the west end of the swamp. He is friendly.
fp Stonard
accept Little Morsels | Cersei Dusksinger, Stonard.
accept Pool of Tears | Fel'zerul, Stonard.
accept 698 Lack of Surplus | Dar, just outside Stonard.
accept Fresh Meat | Dar.
complete 698 Lack of Surplus | Unprepared Sawtooth Flanks from Sawtooth Crocolisks around the lakes east of Stonard.
complete Little Morsels | The captured crocolisk, jaguar and tarantula in the north-east of the swamp.
complete Draenethyst Crystals | Draenethyst Crystals on the ground in the same north-east area.
complete Pool of Tears | Atal'ai Artifacts on the ground around the Pool of Tears, east of Stonard.
turnin 698 Lack of Surplus | Tok'Kar at the Misty Reed Strand, south-east coast.
accept 699 Lack of Surplus
complete 699 Lack of Surplus | Sawtooth Snapper Claws from Sawtooth Snappers on the east coast, north of Tok'Kar.
complete Fresh Meat | Monstrous Crawler Legs from Monstrous Crawlers on the same east coast.
turnin 699 Lack of Surplus | Tok'Kar.
accept 1422 Threat From the Sea
turnin 1422 Threat From the Sea | Katar, next to Tok'Kar.
accept 1426 Threat From the Sea
complete 1426 Threat From the Sea | Marsh Murlocs, Inkspewers and Flesheaters on the beach south of Katar.
turnin 1426 Threat From the Sea
accept 1427 Threat From the Sea
turnin 1427 Threat From the Sea | Tok'Kar.
accept Continued Threat [optional] | Katar. Needs level 41; skipped if you are lower.
complete Continued Threat [optional] | Marsh Inkspewers, Flesheaters and Oracles on the same beach.
turnin Continued Threat [optional]
turnin Little Morsels | Stonard.
turnin Pool of Tears | Fel'zerul.
turnin Fresh Meat | Dar.
turnin Draenethyst Crystals | Magtoor, at the west end of the swamp.
level 40
train | Fly from Stonard to Orgrimmar to train.
note Fly from Stonard to Orgrimmar and on to Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh (zeppelin route if you lack the path).
